{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523","id":1048332507,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f84-fEjb","number":80523,"title":"SQL: Queries with script filter result in a linear scan through all documents even if `LIMIT` is used","user":{"login":"Luegg","id":1016746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTY3NDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1016746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg","html_url":"https://github.com/Luegg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":912794284,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MTI3OTQyODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Analytics/SQL","name":":Analytics/SQL","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"SQL querying"},{"id":1967501040,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NTAxMDQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:QL%20(Deprecated)","name":"Team:QL (Deprecated)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for query languages team"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2021-11-09T08:41:07Z","updated_at":"2022-02-15T10:10:56Z","closed_at":"2022-02-15T10:10:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"For example, the query `SELECT station.name FROM \\\"weather-data-2016\\\" WHERE LENGTH(station.name) > 10 LIMIT 10` takes more than 60s on the NOAA benchmark dataset. The equivalent search request on the other hand only takes a few ms:\r\n\r\n```\r\nPOST http://localhost:39200/weather-data-2016/_search\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"size\": 10,\r\n  \"query\": {\r\n    \"script\": {\r\n      \"script\": {\r\n        \"source\": \"InternalQlScriptUtils.nullSafeFilter(InternalQlScriptUtils.gt(InternalSqlScriptUtils.length(InternalQlScriptUtils.docValue(doc,params.v0)),params.v1))\",\r\n        \"lang\": \"painless\",\r\n        \"params\": {\r\n          \"v0\": \"station.name\",\r\n          \"v1\": 5\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"boost\": 1.0\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"_source\": false,\r\n  \"fields\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"field\": \"station.name\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"sort\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"_doc\": {\r\n        \"order\": \"asc\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote, the search request does not open a scroll context but SQL does. Opening the scroll context causes ES to count all matching documents which requires to evaluate the script on every doc.\r\n\r\nThis issue could be addressed by using PIT instead of scroll contexts (see https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/61873).","closed_by":{"login":"elasticsearchmachine","id":58790826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58790826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/elasticsearchmachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/80523/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}